{"id":258881,"name":"Ancient Sands 03-3-08, 2BDR","headline":"The 2BDR Sunlit Poolview @ Ancient Sands","summary":"This waterfront 2 bedroom apartment is located in Gouna's beloved Ancient Sands community— is the ideal retreat for couples and families seeking relaxation with a touch of modern charm, it offers both serenity and convenience.","description":{"Space":"\r\n\r\nThis enriched 2-bedroom apartment in Ancient Sands With free access to pool, and just a 15-minute walk from the Marina.\r\n\r\nInside, you’ll find:\r\n✔️ Two thoughtfully designed bedrooms with cozy beds and calming, stylish decor\r\n✔️ Two full ensuite  bathrooms, and one for guests — with fresh towels provided\r\n✔️ A welcoming living room with comfortable seating and natural light\r\n✔️ An open-plan, fully equipped kitchen with a microwave, kettle, Nespresso machine, utensils, and washing machine\r\n✔️ A private balcony \r\n✔️ A 55” Smart TV with AirPlay and cable channels\r\n✔️ Complimentary bottled water and Nespresso coffee capsules\r\n\r\n","Access":"\r\n\r\n✔️ Guests will have full private access to the apartment and all of its amenities during their stay\r\n✔️ Guests will also enjoy access to compound facilities (pools, communal areas — subject to compound rules)\r\n✔️ For larger groups or multiple bookings, feel free to contact us — we may have additional units available in the same compound or nearby.\r\n\r\n","Interaction":"\r\n\r\n✔️We’re available to assist you between 9:00 AM and 4:00 AM Cairo time.\r\n✔️Whether you have questions before arrival or need help during your stay, our team is happy to support you on via Airbnb messages throughout your experience.\r\n\r\n","Neighborhood":"\r\n\r\nAncient Sands is El Gouna's elite community uniquely located just 15min from Abu Tig Marina, Guests enjoy both convenience and exclusivity, with direct access to sandy beaches and some of Gouna’s best dining and lifestyle spots.\r\n\r\n✔️ Wonderful location with direct access to El Gouna’s beaches\r\n✔️ Abu Tig Marina – famous for yachts, fine dining, nightlife, and seaside strolls (15 min walk)\r\n✔️ Bright Star supermarket – directly in front of the residence toward the Marina\r\n✔️ ZOUNi Beach Lounge – (15 min walk)\r\n✔️ The Smokery – a local favorite, just 2 kilo meters away\r\n✔️ Downtown El Gouna – lively hub with restaurants, cafés, shops, bars, and supermarkets\r\n✔️ Popular beach clubs and lounges nearby (charges may apply)\r\n✔️ Wide range of water sports – kitesurfing, diving, and boat trips\r\n✔️ Family-friendly facilities – shared pools, landscaped gardens, and outdoor spaces\r\n✔️ Safe, gated community with 24/7 security\r\n✔️ Everyday convenience – supermarkets, pharmacies, and essential services close by\r\n✔️ Cultural and lifestyle events – film festivals, concerts, and exhibitions often hosted in El Gouna\r\n\r\n","Transit":"\r\n\r\n✔️ Tuk-tuks are the most popular and convenient way to get around Gouna\r\n✔️ Walking distance to beaches, restaurants, and supermarkets \r\n✔️ Downtown El Gouna: 10–15 mins (cafes, supermarkets, pharmacies)\r\n✔️ Abu Tig Marina: About a 15-minute walk (restaurants, shops, nightlife, yachts)\r\n✔️ Gouna Conference Center & Golf Courses: 10–15 mins\r\n✔️ El Gouna Hospital: 10–15 mins\r\n✔️ Hurghada International Airport: 30–40 mins\r\n✔️ Free Parking on premises\r\n\r\n","Notes":"\r\n\r\n⚠️ Entry Requirements for El Gouna\r\n✔️Egyptian nationals: National ID (front & back) + authentic proof of marriage (for couples)\r\n✔️Arab nationals: Passport copy + authentic proof of marriage (for couples)\r\n✔️Other nationalities: Passport copy only (no marriage proof required)\r\n\r\n⚠️ If one partner is Egyptian/Arab and the other is not, proof of marriage is required\r\n✔️ QR Codes for entry are issued by El Gouna Community Care. Please submit all required IDs 48 hours before check-in so we can arrange your entry QR.\r\nLate submissions may cause delays or denial of entry. Approvals are fully at the discretion of El Gouna Community Care.\r\n✔️ Smoking is only allowed outdoors (fine of $100 applies indoors)\r\n✔️ Visitors are not permitted — only registered guests may enter\r\n✔️ Please switch off AC and lights when leaving the apartment\r\n✔️ Kindly leave the unit tidy upon checkout."},"city":"El Gouna","capacity_of_guests":4,"number_of_bedrooms":2,"number_of_beds":4,"number_of_bathrooms":3,"number_of_stars":5,"location_address1":"Ancient Sands Compound","location_address2":"","location_lat":"27.402484","location_lng":"33.6511438","booking_link":null,"airbnb_link":null,"rental_type":"apartment","featured":true,"cleaning_fee":25,"checkin_time":15,"checkout_time":11,"booking_sync_cleaning_fee_id":505582,"active":1,"can_book":1,"agreement":"• Kindly note that a damage deposit of USD 150 (or the equivalent in EGP) is required. The payment is collected online as part of the reservation payment and will be reimbursed on the checkout day, provided no damages are incurred.\r\n  • Smoking (including shisha) inside the unit is strictly not allowed. However it is allowed in the unit’s balcony (if applicable). A fine of $100 may be imposed in case of smoking indoors.\r\n • Partying, excessive noise and public alcohol drinking is not allowed. In case of violations, security will be notified and appropriate strict actions will be taken. \r\n • Visitors are not allowed, only confirmed guests stated in the reservation will be granted entry. \r\n• Egyptian & Arab couples ONLY are required to provide proof of marriage according to Egyptian law. Guests are required to send their IDs or passports to the email (id@xurustays.com) or (id.elgouna@xurustays.com) as per the local regulations.\r\n• El Gouna entry permits require 48 hours to be issued, in case guest IDs and passports are sent less than 48 hours before check in date, entry permits are subject to delay or may not be granted. \r\n • Cancellation more than 30 days before the arrival date, we keep 10% of the total price of the stay.\r\n • Cancella